         <description>
            <p>
               Installs the FilterZWOFit PixInsight feature script with single-image and batch FILTER keyword updates.
            </p>
            <p>
               New in 1.0.18:
               <br/>- Folder batch mode now includes all subfolders recursively.
               <br/>- Batch mode processes only light and flat frames by default (IMAGETYP header); darks, dark flats and bias frames are skipped. Can be disabled in the dialog.
            </p>
            <p>
               New in 1.0.19:
               <br/>- The script name is now shown in the History Explorer.
            </p>
            <p>
               Installed files:
               <br/>src/scripts/Tricx/FilterZWOFit/FilterZWOFit.js
               <br/>src/scripts/Tricx/FilterZWOFit/FilterZWOFit.svg
               <br/>src/scripts/Tricx/FilterZWOFit/FilterZWOFit.xsgn
            </p>
         </description>
      </package>
   </platform>
